                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEMINFORMATIONSÜBERTRAGUNGSVERFAHREN UND -VORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET DISPOSITIF DE TRANSMISSION D'INFORMATIONS SYSTÈME</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEM INFORMATION TRANSMISSION METHOD AND DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided are a method and device for sending system information. The method for sending system information comprises: generating, by a first communication node, first system information indicative of indication information corresponding to second system information, wherein the second system information is used for assisting a second communication node to access a system; sending the first system information to the second communication node; receiving, by the second communication node, the first system information sent from the first communication node; receiving, according to the indication information of the first system information, the second system information; and accessing, according to the second system information, the system.</p>
            </abstract>
